{"ID":"20260113013222-73kfe4y","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260113013222-73kfe4y","title":"Тестовый блокнот","type":"doc","updated":"20260113015803","updated-by":"pa"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013222-6alery8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013222-6alery8","updated":"20260113013335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Расскажи мне про модель nemotron-3-nano:30b-cloud"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-6c93tze","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-6c93tze","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Nemotron‑3‑Nano 30B‑cloud"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – ультралёгкая производственная версия гражданской LLM Nemotron от NVIDIA."}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-rlaqykd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-rlaqykd","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ключевые характеристики"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-5p8r5bs","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"|","id":"20260113013523-5p8r5bs","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Параметр"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Значение"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Модель"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Nemotron 3‑Nano (30 B)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Объём модели"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"30 архитектурных блоков (плотность ≈ 30 млрд параметров)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Аппаратные требования"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"• 1 GPU (объём видеопамяти ≈ 16 GB) для базового инференса "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"• При необходимости более быстрой выдачи — 2 GPU (по 16 GB) в режиме tensor‑parallel"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Объём памяти"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Поскольку модель полностью загружается в виде «FP16»/«INT8»‑квантов, в RAM/SSD хранится лишь несколько дней‑часов битов‑данных модели; в рабочей оперативке достаточно 16 GB VRAM"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Языковой репертуар"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Английский, русский, китайский, испанский, французский — полный набор «свободных» вероятностей одинакового уровня качества"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Темпока"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Инференс ≈ 150 токенов/сек на 1 GPU (при FP16); 300 токенов/сек при INT8 и динамическом батчинге"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Точность вывода"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"С учётом весов «компрессионального» хранилища: "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"• Точность ≥ 90 % (внутренний F1 на стандартных задачах сравнимо с 40B‑версией) "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"• BLEU/ROUGE Compared to 13B‑Benchmark – различий менее 0,5 %"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Качество"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Соответствует топ‑15% самых сильных популярных моделей LLaMa/Alpaca‑2 уровней 30 B, однако приведен к «небольшому» размерам за счёт глубокой квантовой компрессии"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Обучение"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Переподобрено на доменных блоках (технические инструкции, юридические документы, научные статьи) затем прошедшее «light‑fine‑tune» с 5 млн. запросов‑ответов, захваченных из реального «cloud‑API»"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Локализация"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Поддержка русского в полной плотности «token‑level» (приблизительно 32 000 русских токенов) и «рамочного» синтаксиса без потери «английского» контекста"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-kw5ptex","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-kw5ptex","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Преимущества"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-fr1wali","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-fr1wali","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-v8xdszg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-v8xdszg","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-svysfd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-svysfd5","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Небольшая память:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" модель помещается в 1 GPU — идеально для «edge‑cloud» и «on‑premise» сценариев без необходимости кластера."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-vwwmiu8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-vwwmiu8","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-w369eqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-w369eqa","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Высокая скорость:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 150 t/s при одновременном обслуживании 1‑2‑х запросов, значит низкая задержка, подходящая для интерактивных чатов и «real‑time» inference."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-2p78tfo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-2p78tfo","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-3f6iwny","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-3f6iwny","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Универсальная мультиязычность:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" все 5‑смртовые языки проходят тесты на сложности ниже 7 % (за сравнение с Alpa‑2‑13B), что позволяет использовать одну модель как везде: чат‑боты, генерацию текста, дообавление кода."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-6scwukh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-6scwukh","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-u55jzos","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-u55jzos","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Компрессия без потери семантики:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" благодаря DeepCompression™‑технологии оптимальное удержание более 90 % оригинальной «логической полноты»."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-2mnuv9a","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-2mnuv9a","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-ench5er","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-ench5er","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Масштабируемость:"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" модель поддерживает динамический batch‑size до 128 токенов, позволяя «автоматически» масштабировать нагрузку при пиках сервиса."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-l66rb75","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-l66rb75","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ограничения"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-zud6q4u","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"|","id":"20260113013523-zud6q4u","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ограничений"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Описание"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Модельный размер 30 B"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"При полном 64‑битном представлении требовалось \u003e 400 GB VRAM; поэтому используется 16‑битная (FP16) паковка; если требуется 8‑битная версия, точность падает до 85 %."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Точность для очень специализированных задач"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"На узкоспециализированных наборах (медицинская нюансированная диагностика, высокотехнологичное моделирование) может быть небольшое отклонение от полной версии (разница \u003c 3 % в F1)."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"*"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Отсутствие «image‑multimodal»"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Поддерживается только текстовый ввод; обработка изображений/видео требует отдельного патча."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Лицензирование"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Доступна по коммерческой лицензии NVIDIA‑NIM, с ограничением на облачную доставку только в рамках «NVIDIA‑GPU Cloud»."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-w77pq0d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-w77pq0d","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Как использовать (примерный API‑запрос)"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-hkkgquf","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-hkkgquf","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YmFzaA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"curl -X POST https://api.nvidia.com/v1/completions \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $NVIDIA_API_KEY\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\n        \"model\": \"nemotron-3-nano-30b-cloud\",\n        \"prompt\": \"Объясни, почему океан считается самым большим биосферным резерфором планеты.\",\n        \"max_tokens\": 256,\n        \"temperature\": 0.7,\n        \"top_p\": 0.9\n      }'\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-ov8kcyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-ov8kcyw","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Ответ"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": JSON‑объект с полем "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"choices[0].text"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ содержащий сгенерированный ответ (пример: «Океан…»)."}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-wh3jwuo","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-wh3jwuo","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Применения"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-n4wqg7y","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-n4wqg7y","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-u3axfvy","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-u3axfvy","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-8bm0hva","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-8bm0hva","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Чат‑боты"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" для корпоративного портала (поддержка русского и английского)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-7riirng","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-7riirng","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-mhw7tyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-mhw7tyz","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Сервисы генерации контента"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (маркетинговые тексты, FAQ, техническая документация)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-rs4f2bv","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-rs4f2bv","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-o60lk89","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-o60lk89","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Код‑генерация"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" и "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"приложение автодополнения"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" в IDE‑клиентах (меньший overhead, чем модели 70 B)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-7ir2tp2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-7ir2tp2","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-vu9lc7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-vu9lc7k","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Микросервисы"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" в облаке (Edge‑CPU/GPU) где нужен быстрый ответ без высокой стоимости вычислений."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-vo86g0c","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-vo86g0c","updated":"20260113013523"}},{"ID":"20260113013523-q8lexuw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-q8lexuw","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Кратко"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-l6hvrln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-l6hvrln","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Nemotron‑3‑Nano 30B‑cloud"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – это модель среднего размера (≈ 30 млрд параметров), укомпрессированная и квантованная для размещения на одном GPU, но при этом демонстрирующая "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"незначительные потери качества"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (≈ 90 % точности оригинальной версии). Сочетание "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"мультиязычности"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":", "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"быстрого инференса"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" и "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"низкого энергопотребления"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" делает её оптимальной для продакшн‑развёртываний в облаке, где важна экономия ресурсов и поддержание высокой скорости обслуживания."}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-jy3ss6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-jy3ss6k","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Если нужна более детальная информация о конкретных гиперпараметрах (например, температура, top‑p) или рекомендации по настройке пайплайна в Kubernetes, дайте знать — подготовлю конфигурационные файлы."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Nemotron‑3‑nano:30B‑cloud – краткое резюме"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-qxs3zji","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"|","id":"20260113013523-qxs3zji","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Параметр"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Описание"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Архитектура"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Трёхмерная трансформер‑модель (Transformer‑based) с 30 млрд параметров. Обеспечивает высокий уровень качества генерации текста, при этом умеет эффективно масштабироваться в облаке благодаря оптимизированному распределённому обучению и инференсу."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Размер"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"30 Б сковеров (≈30 млн параметров). Несмотря на относительно небольшие размеры, демонстрирует конкурентоспособные показатели понимания контекста, генерации логических цепочек и многократных шагов рассуждения."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Облачный режим"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Доступна как сервис в облаке (Cloud). Пользователи могут вызывать модель через API без необходимости локального хостинга. Это упрощает интеграцию в веб‑приложения, чат‑боты, аналитические платформы и другие сервисы."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Скорость и эффективность"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Оптимизирована для минимального лавина‑запаздывания (latency) благодаря динамическому размеру батчей и использованию квантованных/битовых представлений в продакшене. Подходит для реального времени (до ≈ 50 мс/запрос при достаточном кластере)."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Гибкость prompt‑ов"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Поддерживает бесплатные и «structured» формы ввода: "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"• "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Zero‑shot"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – просто задача в виде вопроса/инструкций. "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"• "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Few‑shot"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – несколько примеров в контексте. "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"• "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Chain‑of‑Thought"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – цепочки рассуждений, позволяющие решать сложные задачи."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Тонкая настройка"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Возможна дообуровка (fine‑tuning) на собственных данных через сервис Cloud, что позволяет адаптировать модель под профили пользователей, домены (медицина, финансы, образование) и требования к стилистике."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Безопасность и этика"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Интегрированы механизмы фильтрации токсичных Output, а также возможность установки "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"content‑policy"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"‑ограничений через конфигурацию API."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Лицензия"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Открытый/кросс‑транспортный (по условиям NVIDIA) – подходит как для исследовательских, так и коммерческих проектов, при соблюдении условий лицензирования."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Поддержка"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Официальные SDK и клиентские библиотеки для Python, JavaScript, Java; подробные руководства и примеры для быстрого старта."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-tdzhzah","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-tdzhzah","updated":"20260113013523"}},{"ID":"20260113013523-d8ax7zr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-d8ax7zr","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Как использовать в Cloud"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-237mj1f","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-237mj1f","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-v2qydrm","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-v2qydrm","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-hmmgg7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-hmmgg7x","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Регистрация и подготовка аккаунта"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – создание проекта в NVIDIA Cloud (NGC, GPU‑кластеры)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-pqw4zg6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-pqw4zg6","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-ivb8tmg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-ivb8tmg","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Запуск модели"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – через "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"curl"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, REST‑API или Python‑SDK ("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"nvidia‑ai‑cloud"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​). Пример простого запроса:"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-tju0sxz","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-tju0sxz","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YmFzaA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"curl -X POST https://api.nvidia.com/v1/models/nemotron-3-nano-30b-cloud/generate \\\n     -H \"Authorization: Bearer \u003cyour_api_token\u003e\" \\\n     -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n     -d '{\n           \"prompt\": \"Объясни, почему небо синее, простыми словами.\",\n           \"max_tokens\": 150,\n           \"temperature\": 0.7,\n           \"top_p\": 0.9,\n           \"stream\": true\n         }'\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-iil82qt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-iil82qt","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-37g7nvq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-37g7nvq","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Параметры ответа"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"max_tokens"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"temperature"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"top_k"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"top_p"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​, "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"presence_penalty"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ и др. позволяют сбалансировать креативность и детерминированность."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-59kg0my","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-59kg0my","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-sklba8i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-sklba8i","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Мониторинг"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – метрики latency, throughput, usage‑metering доступны через панель управления."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-e1ukon7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-e1ukon7","updated":"20260113013523"}},{"ID":"20260113013523-qc53s73","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-qc53s73","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ключевые преимущества для разработчиков"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-nfggvmr","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"|","id":"20260113013523-nfggvmr","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Преимущество"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Пояснение"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Минимальная инфраструктурная нагрузка"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Не нужно управлять GPU‑кластерами локально; всё масштабируется в облаке."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Высокая производительность"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"30 B‑параметрная модель в облаке быстрее, чем аналогичный offline‑режим на обычных серверах."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Гибкая интеграция"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"API‑first подход, поддержка потокового ввода/вывода (streaming), удобен для чат‑ботов и мейн‑сайтов."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Экономия"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Платите только за запросы/токены, а не за постоянно запущенные инстансы."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Регулярные обновления"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Модель поддерживается и обновляется без простоя – всегда доступна новейшая версия."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-tgc7z99","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-tgc7z99","updated":"20260113013523"}},{"ID":"20260113013523-c6u849g","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-c6u849g","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Когда выбирать Nemotron‑3‑nano:30B‑cloud?"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-rla05bu","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-rla05bu","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-k0ag4ay","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-k0ag4ay","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-d2e3w0k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-d2e3w0k","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Требуется быстрый ответ"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" в реальном времени (чат‑боты, интерактивные приложения)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-6rlq9ed","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-6rlq9ed","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-zzy5u4t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-zzy5u4t","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Ограничены ресурсы"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" локального сервера, но нужен мощный LLM."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-pl1cb31","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-pl1cb31","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-lg7xvul","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-lg7xvul","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Нужна возможность тонкой настройки"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" под специфический домен, но без самостоятельного обучения huge‑scale модели."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-fcqaqw9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-fcqaqw9","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-1skr0vk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-1skr0vk","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Важна поддержка от поставщика"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (NVIDIA) и готовность к соблюдению политики использования и этических рамок."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-fajd802","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-fajd802","updated":"20260113013523"}},{"ID":"20260113013523-mxnop9s","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-mxnop9s","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Кратко"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-7foqkw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-7foqkw1","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Nemotron-3-nano:30B-cloud"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ – облачный сервис от NVIDIA, предоставляющий доступ к мощной 30‑млн‑параметровой версии модели Nemotron‑3. Он сочетает высокую скорость инференса, гибкую настройку через API и возможности дообучения, что делает его идеальным решением для современных AI‑приложений, где требуется масштабируемость и надёжность без локального оборудования."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Nemotron-3-Nano:30B-Cloud"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – это крупная параметрическая модель, разработанная компанией "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"NVIDIA"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" в рамках их семейства "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Nemotron"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":". Ниже – основные характеристики и возможности этой модели:"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-m0946xo","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"|","id":"20260113013523-m0946xo","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Параметр"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Значение"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Архитектура"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Трансформер‑based"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Размер модели"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"~30 млрд параметров"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Тип"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Текст‑в‑текст (LLM)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Область применения"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Генерация и суммирование текста, ответы на вопросы, диалоговые системы, код‑генерация, извлечение информации и т.п."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Оптимизация"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Точная «инференс‑оптимизация» для быстрого и энергоэффективного вывода"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Размещение"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Доступна в "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"облачной"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" инфраструктуре NVIDIA (NVIDIA Cloud GPU‑инстансы)."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-tnm8lc7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-tnm8lc7","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Что делает модель «nano:30b-cloud» особенной?"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-15a7d3i","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-15a7d3i","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-nehhzoz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-nehhzoz","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-kyhhn5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-kyhhn5j","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Размер «nano»"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – относительное уменьшение по сравнению с гигантскими моделями 70 B+; при этом сохраняется высокий уровень качества, что позволяет размещать её на серверах с умеренными GPU (A100, A30 и т.д.) и масштабировать горизонтально."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-bs39h13","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-bs39h13","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-flxca4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-flxca4y","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Облачный deployment"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – модель поставляется как сервис‑контейнер (Docker/PyTorchServe) с готовыми API‑эндпоинтами, что упрощает интеграцию в production‑окружения без самостоятельной настройки весов."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-gn2nrdt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-gn2nrdt","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-ri9qz3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-ri9qz3e","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Встроенные оптимизации"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – использование "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"FP16/BF16"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" и "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"TensorRT‑accelerated"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" вывод делает latency \u003c 30 мс для типичных запросов, сравнимое с более крупными ответами."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-bkiy16m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-bkiy16m","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-zchtodd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-zchtodd","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Multilingual support"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – обучена на датасете, охватывающем более 100 языков, однако она лучше всего показывает результаты в английском и русском."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-eqa1mew","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-eqa1mew","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-xekcdbs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-xekcdbs","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Safety‑filters"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – встроенный набор правил‑контролей (toxicity, bias, PII) позволяет использовать модель в публичных продуктах без отдельного фильтрового слоя (при необходимости их можно отключить)."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-kwtw3qg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-kwtw3qg","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Типичные сценарии использования"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-hexxxf1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-hexxxf1","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-al1e8jh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-al1e8jh","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-8zx9nyg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-8zx9nyg","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Чат‑боты и диалоговые агенты"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – быстрый ответ с низкой латентностью."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-wk5o6a9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-wk5o6a9","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-o6az9ml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-o6az9ml","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Контент‑генерация"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – написание статей, рекламных слоганов, технической документации."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-qfb0t36","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-qfb0t36","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-i3f4df1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-i3f4df1","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Суммаризация и экстракция"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – создание кратких выписок из больших текстов."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-y1ylmhp","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-y1ylmhp","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-wgy37up","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-wgy37up","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Код‑помощник"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – генерация фрагментов кода (Python, JavaScript, C++) и объяснение их работы."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-igvvmkt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-igvvmkt","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-n89cxjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-n89cxjh","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Локализация"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – перевод и адаптация текста между языками."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-7av376t","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-7av376t","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-tah4r9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-tah4r9r","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Развертывание на edge‑устройствах"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – благодаря размеру 30 B её можно запускать на NVIDIA Jetson с GPUDirect‑RDMA."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-mmk3nx0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-mmk3nx0","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Как получить доступ"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-0sa6qnl","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-0sa6qnl","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-m57rrls","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-m57rrls","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-gstm14b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-gstm14b","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"NVIDIA NGC"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – репозиторий с предобученными весами и Docker‑образами."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-54tu69m","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-54tu69m","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-ufcjex9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-ufcjex9","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"API‑доступ"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – платформа NVIDIA AI Foundations (подписка/по‑токенному тарифу)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-lpa9mm0","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-lpa9mm0","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-9ba98g1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-9ba98g1","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"CLI / SDK"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – готовятся клиентские библиотеки на Python и C++ для простого вызова модели через REST/GRPC."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-i3gypcf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-i3gypcf","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Пример запроса и ответа (Python‑SDK)"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-rvhlm6f","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-rvhlm6f","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"cHl0aG9u"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"from nemotron import InferenceClient\n\nclient = InferenceClient(\n    endpoint=\"https://ai.nvidia.com/v1/models/nemotron-3-nano:30b-cloud\",\n    api_key=\"YOUR_API_KEY\"\n)\n\nresponse = client.chat(\n    messages=[\n        {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"Объясни, как работает обратное распространение ошибки в нейронных сетях.\"},\n        {\"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"Отличный вопрос! ...\"}  # предыдущий ответ\n    ],\n    max_tokens=150,\n    temperature=0.7,\n)\n\nprint(response.choices[0].message.content)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-k3gliyl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-k3gliyl","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"В результате получим лаконичное, но технически корректное объяснение, что иллюстрирует возможностей модели."}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-c1z62v7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-c1z62v7","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Кратко"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-6mhvdyp","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-6mhvdyp","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-lsx0a2j","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-lsx0a2j","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-7dlmxyu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-7dlmxyu","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Nemotron‑3‑nano:30B‑cloud"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – 30‑млрд‑параметрическая трансформер‑модель от NVIDIA, оптимизированная для быстрого облачного инференса."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-sya5equ","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-sya5equ","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-jvprkfh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-jvprkfh","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Технологический баланс между мощью и эффективностью, позволяющий использовать её в продуктах с умеренными ресурсами."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-jaabnn1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-jaabnn1","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-e5uisw8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-e5uisw8","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Доступна через NVIDIA NGC и API, поддерживает несколько языков и имеет встроенные механизмы безопасности."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-mhrupmd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-mhrupmd","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Если нужна более конкретная информация (например, подробные метрики производительности, инструкции по fine‑tuning под ваш датасет или примеры интеграции в микросервисы), дайте знать — я подготовлю её."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Nemotron-3‑Nanо: 30B‑Cloud"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" – современная многоязычная нейросетевая платформа от NVIDIA, разработанная для работы в облаке и оптимизированная под масштабные вычислительные ресурсы. Ниже — основные характеристики и преимущества модели."}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-h4y1w30","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-h4y1w30","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"| Пункт | Описание |\n|-------|----------|\n| "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Размер модели"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" | 30 миллиардов параметров (≈30 B). |\n| "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Архитектура"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" | Трансформер‑декодер типа GPT‑3, доработанный для длительного контекста и высокой плотности токенов. |\n| "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Контекст"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" | Поддержка до 32 000 токенов (≈ 24 К слов), что позволяет работать с объёмными документами и длинными диалогами. |\n| "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Многоязычность"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" | Обучена на более чем 100 языках, включая русский, английский, китайский, испанский и др. |\n| "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Облачная развертывание"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" | Предлагается в виде управляемого сервиса "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"NVIDIA AI Cloud"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (API‑endpoint, autoscaling, SLA‑гарантии). |\n| "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Инференс‑оптимизация"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" | Поддержка TensorRT‑UFA, FP8/FP16‑квантов, а также «continuous batching» для снижения задержек. |\n| "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"API‑доступ"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" | REST и gRPC‑интерфейсы, поддержка современных SDK: Python, JavaScript, Java, C#. |\n| "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Безопасность"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" | Встроенные механизмы контроля доступа, шифрования данных в передаче и в покое, возможность изоляции tenant‑specific модели. |\n| "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Настройка под задачу"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" | Возможность fine‑tuning (до 5 % параметров) через LoRA/Adapter‑based методы без полного переобучения. |\n| "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Применение"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" | • Генерация текста, резюме и перевода\n• Код‑комплинг и рефакторинг\n• Чат‑боты, виртуальные помощники\n• Анализ запросов, классификация и т.п. |\n| "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Лицензирование"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" | Доступно по подписке/платформе «pay‑as‑you‑go» в рамках NVIDIA AI Foundations; условия гибкие (по часам, токенам, запросам). |"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-b3038e3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-b3038e3","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Ключевые преимущества"}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-ukiwjhh","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-ukiwjhh","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-0w38mb3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-0w38mb3","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-u218v56","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-u218v56","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Высокая скорость"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" благодаря оптимизации под GPU Ampere/Hopper и облачным кластерам NVIDIA."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-qta77zl","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-qta77zl","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-f84cjwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-f84cjwu","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Масштабируемость"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — легко добавлять/удалять реплики под нагрузку без перерыва."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-btzvos6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-btzvos6","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-z3mkrqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-z3mkrqv","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Гибкость"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — возможность кастомизировать модель под конкретные бизнес‑задачи."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-4ahm5cw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-4ahm5cw","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113013523-13nbhz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-13nbhz2","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Экономия ресурсов"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" — поддержка низкоразрядных форматов (FP8) снижает стоимость инференса."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113013523-hsmbaqz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20260113013523-hsmbaqz","updated":"20260113013523"},"Children":[{