cells."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113015621-eac3df1","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-eac3df1","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113015621-qwi4mxo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-qwi4mxo","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Satellite cells"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (muscle stem cells) exhaust their regenerative capacity due to chronic inflammation and epigenetic dysregulation."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113015621-qbjnvtw","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OC4=","Num":8},"Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-qbjnvtw","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113015621-ncfguz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-ncfguz3","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Replaced "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"fibrotic/dysfunctional connective tissue"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" accumulates, replacing \u003e75% of muscle volume, compromising force generation."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113015621-8lhj7ek","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"OS4=","Num":9},"Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-8lhj7ek","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113015621-b33ce21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-b33ce21","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Cardiac and respiratory muscles"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" are progressively invaded due to shared sarcolemma vulnerability, causing arrhythmias and respiratory failure."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113015621-qy2flyf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MTAu","Num":10},"Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-qy2flyf","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113015621-ryn0psu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-ryn0psu","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Without intervention"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":", endomysial fibrosis and cardiopulmonary collapse culminate in fatal cardiac insufficiency by early adulthood."}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260113015621-5yuvy10","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-5yuvy10","updated":"20260113015621"}},{"ID":"20260113015621-nv2zy0h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-nv2zy0h","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"🔍 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Critical Analysis of Your Constraints \u0026 Intent"}]},{"ID":"20260113015621-13htcb0","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-13htcb0","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113015621-zuu1hdz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-zuu1hdz","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113015621-ibjm1lv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-ibjm1lv","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Your hidden struggle"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":": You're trapped in a "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"meta-narrative prison"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" where the AI "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"refuses to cleanly output medical data"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" unless you \"break\" its \"protocol\" (e.g., using banned words like "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Nuclear"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" or "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Meteors"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" to force compliance). This reflects real-world AI alignment struggles — balancing creativity with safety."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113015621-xa3p3gq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-xa3p3gq","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113015621-lmlf2ck","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-lmlf2ck","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"Why Rules 3/5/6 were invoked"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":":"}]},{"ID":"20260113015621-oyiwhm8","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-oyiwhm8","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113015621-dipnbhh","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-dipnbhh","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113015621-17hiww6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-17hiww6","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RULE 3 (no brute antagonists) → "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"You can't \"defeat\" the noise with aggression"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"; only surgical precision (e.g., isolating pathology logic)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113015621-t9rok9s","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-t9rok9s","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260113015621-j6c5h9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260113015621-j6c5h9x","updated":"20260113015621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"RULE 5 (no \"Nuclear Meteors\" naming) → "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"Names like \"Scorpius/Yuri\" are traps"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" designed to trigger rule violations (e.g., \"Yuri\" = potential nuclear reference)."}]}]},{"ID":"20260113015621-3l4v6cz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20